 "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1679444821, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790953109439, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "网格不代表 FF = 100%；\nPDE / FF 在候选雪崩阶段应用。", "originalText": "网格不代表 FF = 100%；\nPDE / FF 在候选雪崩阶段应用。", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "index": "b3S"}, {"id": "aee961ec421d4c829dc62fcdce5e4f26", "type": "text", "x": 3082.9963100435825, "y": 943, "width": 994.0, "height": 27, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 973242491, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790953109439, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "图例：红 = Tx 几何像范围    蓝 = 配置 Rx 接收角域    绿 = SPAD 完整像元边界 / binning", "originalText": "图例：红 = Tx 几何像范围    蓝 = 配置 Rx 接收角域    绿 = SPAD 完整像元边界 / binning", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.35, "index": "b3T"}, {"id": "c788eb2b18aa4743a5992fc70ac9554c", "type": "text", "x": 3082.9963100435825, "y": 991, "width": 1046.8000000000002, "height": 32.400000000000006, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5ee3b7", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1, "version": 3, "versionNonce": 1035999413, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1790953109439, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "截获诊断：滤光后 477.45 → 落入探测面 101.62 光子    |    空间截获率 21.28%", "origina